  "question": {
    "html": "<p>An engine provides a thrust force <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"F\"></span> to move a vehicle at constant velocity <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"v\"></span>. The engine has an efficiency <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"e\"></span> and consumes fuel with an energy density <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"η\"></span>.</p>\n<p>Which expression gives the rate at which the volume of fuel is being consumed by the engine?<br/><br/></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{Fv}{eη}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{Fvη}{e}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{eFv}{η}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{eη}{Fv}\"></span></li></ol>"
  },
